  "zh": "# 今日 AI 热点：OpenAI 推进数学难题与多项产品发布\n## AI 前沿\n- **OpenAI 数学七大难题**：旨在利用大模型攻克长期未解的数学猜想，显示 AI 在基础科学的潜力。\n- **OpenAI Lean 4 形式证明**：结合流体动力学与机器证明，推动 AI 科学验证能力。\n## 产品与工具\n- **OpenAI Agents API**：提供构建自主代理的标准接口，降低企业级 AI 应用门槛。\n- **Cognition SWE-2 模型**：在代码生成 benchmark 上超越 Fable 5.1 并逼近 GPT‑Astra，提升程序员助手效能。\n- **Thelio Mira AI 工作站**：配备 192 GB GPU 显存，专为大模型训练与推理设计，满足高算力需求。\n## 安全与治理\n- **Anthropic AI 滥用报告**：Anthropic 最新威胁情报详述深度伪造与滥用趋势，为政策制定提供依据。\n## 行业动向\n- **Google 购买核电半数电力**：为其数据中心提供低碳能源，间接支持 AI 算力扩张。",
  "en": "# Today's AI Highlights: OpenAI Advances Math Problems and Multiple Product Launches\n## AI Frontier\n- **OpenAI Seven Math**：Aims to leverage large models to solve long‑standing mathematical conjectures, showcasing AI’s potential in fundamental science.\n- **OpenAI Lean4 Proof**：Combines fluid dynamics with machine‑checked proof, advancing AI’s scientific verification capability.\n## Products & Tools\n- **OpenAI Agents API**：Provides a standard interface for building autonomous agents, lowering the barrier for enterprise AI adoption.\n- **Cognition SWE-2**：Surpasses Fable 5.1 on code‑generation benchmarks and nears GPT‑Astra, boosting programmer‑assistant performance.\n- **Thelio Mira AI**：Equipped with 192 GB GPU memory, purpose‑built for large‑model training and inference, meeting high‑compute demands.\n## Safety & Governance\n- **Anthropic Misuse**：Anthropic’s latest threat intelligence details deepfake and abuse trends, informing policy making.\n## Industry Trends\n- **Google Power Deal**：Secures low‑carbon power for its data centers, indirectly supporting AI compute expansion."
